<div id="u-credit-00023-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/falconiformes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5842934); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5842934&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606009466" alt="Falconiformes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5842934)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/falconiformes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5842934); return false;">Falconiformes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585899589 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">03 Apr 2020 07:39</span></p>
